### Create your repository

Before you start using it, get your tools out. Open your browser and navigate to our template repository at <a href="https://github.com/palewire/cuny-jour-static-site-template" target="_blank">github.com/palewire/cuny-jour-static-site-template</a>.

<Screenshot
  src="/screenshots/week-2/template-repo-homepage.png"
